# One UI — Polar SKUs + account kind (locked)

Tarteeb **Polar cards (no-touch):** **Basic → Pro → Business → Business Pro**. Alag theme / alag app / landing pe Personal cards **nahi**.

**Personal vs Business Polar product nahi.** Checkout ke baad onboarding: Personal | Business. Backend session `account_kind`.

| Polar SKU | Default kind | Power | Org rail |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Basic** £23 | personal | Personal Basic — Mail People Calendar Work. Chat/CRM full **nahi** | nahi |
| **Pro** £46 | personal | **= Business Pro power** (Masood). Chat + full CRM. Presentation private | nahi |
| **Business** £97 | business | Company mid-tier + Org + Chat | haan |
| **Business Pro** £2,850 | business | Company book + Org + Chat + CRM activity (Humza) | haan |

**Rule:** Personal Pro = Business Pro **power**, use-case alag (no company Org). Premium copy = same Business Pro Polar SKU + kind personal.

**UI same** — AppShell, mail three-panel, tokens. Kind sirf chrome + gates.

**`ai.anexomail.com`:** wahi UI. Farq sirf AI + **LEO**. Naya CRM / naya mail app **banned**.

- Wall on URL (`PlanSurfaceGate`). Blank nahi.
- LEO mail host pe nahi. Founder/Speed/Admin = founder host.
- `plans.ts` no-touch. Polar pe Personal SKU add **banned**.
